|-------|-------|------------|
| ReLU Strikes Back (osoWxY8q2E) | 7.33 | Topically closest: LLM activation sparsity for inference. That paper requires fine-tuning for relufication but achieves 3× speedup with more complete evaluation. R-Sparse is more novel in its decomposition but has weaker efficiency validation. |
| Sparsing Law (B9XP2R9LtG) | 5.25 | Studies activation sparsity scaling properties; less applied contribution than R-Sparse. |
| SAS: Structured Activation Sparsification (vZfi5to2Xl) | 6.00 | Structured activation sparsity with hardware support; comparable novelty, better hardware integration story than R-Sparse. |
| V:N:M Sparsity (gWHQQagPbN) | 5.80 | Custom sparse kernel with speedup claims, reviewers questioned fairness of speedup comparisons. Similar weakness pattern to R-Sparse. |
