The paper sits between the 5.75 paper (similar ablation profile, our paper is better structured) and the 6.75 paper (similar practical orientation, that paper has slightly more novelty). Given the solid empirical contribution with moderate overclaiming concerns, a score of 6.0 is appropriate—clearly above the borderline but with acknowledged limitations that prevent a higher score.

